                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.51/1016b: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Liberia</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1919-11-19T17:00:00-05:00"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">November 19, 1919, 5
                    p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>It is understood that receivership depositary agreement with Bank of British West
                    Africa expired November 11 but continues in force subject to termination by
                    three months’ notice on either side.</p>
                <p>If Bank serves notice notify Department.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
